    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229730/extras/6cf2ca7723ea98e913e2f9a712cc1353.avif?t=1740954671\" /></div><strong>New Spring: Survival</strong> is a open world zombie survival and crafting RPG where you are trying to stave off the hordes in a procedurally generated post-apocalypse.<br> <br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229730/extras/d90fa1cd78862ca97e30f2508afcff67.avif?t=1740954671\" /></div>Spend the daytime exploring and scavenging for tools and weapons, and hope that it's enough to protect your base when night falls.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Open world. The game engine divides the world into chunks and only keeps the relevant ones in memory, which allows massive map sizes without hogging RAM. \ud83c\udf0e</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> New procedurally generated map to explore for each playthrough. \ud83c\udfb2<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229730/extras/da1635fb23298399fd8d3d33cc620a19.poster.avif?t=1740954671\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229730/extras/da1635fb23298399fd8d3d33cc620a19.webm?t=1740954671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229730/extras/da1635fb23298399fd8d3d33cc620a19.mp4?t=1740954671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Non-linear gameplay. Stay near your base and grow your own food, or live like a nomad travelling from town to town to scavenge supplies. There is no &quot;correct&quot; way to play. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Detailed building and crafting system. Build barricades and line them with barbed wire that you pulled from the remnants of civilization. Craft anything from a nailed baseball bat to a makeshift radio. \ud83d\udee0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Work on 15+ different skill sets which will increase your chances of surviving. \ud83d\udcda<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229730/extras/17968abea6740518a2fa6c505759dc63.poster.avif?t=1740954671\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229730/extras/17968abea6740518a2fa6c505759dc63.webp?t=1740954671\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Keep your character's morale in check to gain performance boosts and avoid sinking into post-apoc depression. How you do this is influenced by your character's personality traits. \ud83c\udfad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Learn farming, cooking, brewing and other ways to become self-sustainable. \ud83c\udf3e<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229730/extras/9bfb368dd0b6c97e50b46acc18f932ae.avif?t=1740954671\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Keep the streets clean with an AK47 (if you can get your hands on one). <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229730/extras/372492813ba095635b8863e0bca044d2.poster.avif?t=1740954671\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229730/extras/372492813ba095635b8863e0bca044d2.webm?t=1740954671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229730/extras/372492813ba095635b8863e0bca044d2.mp4?t=1740954671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
