class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Detailed building and crafting system. Build barricades and line them with barbed wire that you pulled from the remnants of civilization. Craft anything from a nailed baseball bat to a makeshift radio. \ud83d\udee0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Work on 15+ different skill sets which will increase your chances of surviving. \ud83d\udcda<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229730/extras/17968abea6740518a2fa6c505759dc63.poster.avif?t=1740954671\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229730/extras/17968abea6740518a2fa6c505759dc63.webp?t=1740954671\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Keep your character's morale in check to gain performance boosts and avoid sinking into post-apoc depression. How you do this is influenced by your character's personality traits. \ud83c\udfad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Learn farming, cooking, brewing and other ways to become self-sustainable. \ud83c\udf3e<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229730/extras/9bfb368dd0b6c97e50b46acc18f932ae.avif?t=1740954671\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Keep the streets clean with an AK47 (if you can get your hands on one). <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229730/extras/372492813ba095635b8863e0bca044d2.poster.avif?t=1740954671\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229730/extras/372492813ba095635b8863e0bca044d2.webm?t=1740954671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2229730/extras/372492813ba095635b8863e0bca044d2.mp4?t=1740954671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
